{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"正形式"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“正形式”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>$(1,1)$-形式</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"复流形","text":"复流形"}},{"Plain":" $M$ 上的实 $(1,1)$-形式 $\\omega \\in \\mathcal A^{1,1}(M) \\cap \\mathcal A^2(M,\\mathbb{R})$ 称为正的是指对任意非零的实切向量 $v\\in TM$, 都有 $\\omega(v,Jv) &gt;0$.</p>\n"}]}}